WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.525 --> 00:00:16.566
and Mandy stood on the lawn with their parents.

2
00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:20.048
They were all looking at their house.

3
00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:24.950
"Just a few more things we'll do," Dad said proudly.

4
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:27.731
"Then our home will be perfect."

5
00:00:28.651 --> 00:00:31.976
"Today we're going to clean that attic," said Mom.

6
00:00:31.996 --> 00:00:36.057
"Yep, it's filled with junk," Dad said firmly.

7
00:00:37.438 --> 00:00:40.619
Speechless, Mandy poked her brother hard.

8
00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:43.900
"Ouch! We'll do it, Dad!"

9
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.780
said Vinnie, rubbing his arm.

10
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.921
"That's okay.

11
00:00:49.161 --> 00:00:51.622
I'll take care of it," Dad replied.

12
00:00:52.202 --> 00:00:53.622
He went into the house.

13
00:00:53.642 --> 00:00:56.183
"We have to get the album!"

14
00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:57.603
cried Vinnie.

15
00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.144
"Come on!"

16
00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.834
The children ran into the house.

17
00:01:01.854 --> 00:01:05.077
"Whoa! Where are you going?"

18
00:01:05.757 --> 00:01:08.279
Dad shouted as they ran past him.

19
00:01:08.299 --> 00:01:10.982
"We have to do something!"

20
00:01:11.702 --> 00:01:12.483
Vinnie cried.

21
00:01:14.004 --> 00:01:17.767
They raced up the attic stairs and slammed the door shut.

22
00:01:17.787 --> 00:01:20.870
"Vinnie! Grab the album!"

23
00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.351
cried Mandy.

24
00:01:23.392 --> 00:01:26.054
Vinnie opened the album to another page.

25
00:01:26.074 --> 00:01:28.176
"Mandy! Look!"

26
00:01:28.784 --> 00:01:30.805
Vinnie showed her the new photo.

27
00:01:30.825 --> 00:01:34.787
"We don't have time Mandy began.

28
00:01:35.147 --> 00:01:37.968
But her eyes were drawn to the beautiful photo.

29
00:01:39.288 --> 00:01:43.510
The old man was standing in front of a large group of Indians.

30
00:01:44.811 --> 00:01:46.691
They were standing in a circle.

31
00:01:47.972 --> 00:01:51.713
One Indian was holding something like a big belt.

32
00:01:52.534 --> 00:01:53.854
It glowed brightly.

33
00:01:53.874 --> 00:01:57.596
"What's going on up there?"

34
00:01:58.244 --> 00:02:00.545
Dad shouted angrily from below.

35
00:02:02.366 --> 00:02:05.167
Those were the last words the children heard.

36
00:02:06.088 --> 00:02:09.669
Their eyes closed and they fell down the dark tunnel.

37
00:02:12.771 --> 00:02:14.671
They landed on soft soil.

38
00:02:14.691 --> 00:02:18.013
"What's that smell?"

39
00:02:19.493 --> 00:02:20.314
Vinnie moaned.

40
00:02:20.334 --> 00:02:24.976
"Something's burning," replied Mandy.

41
00:02:27.408 --> 00:02:31.411
The children were in a village surrounded by a tall fence.

42
00:02:32.692 --> 00:02:39.298
Around them, long buildings with curved roofs were covered in bark and animal skins.

43
00:02:40.399 --> 00:02:43.461
A large fire burned in the middle of the village.

44
00:02:44.802 --> 00:02:47.624
People were throwing pieces of cloth into it.

45
00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:53.009
A young girl came out of a nearby house.

46
00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.712
She gasped loudly when she saw them.

47
00:02:57.728 --> 00:02:59.109
"How did you get in here?"

48
00:02:59.949 --> 00:03:01.730
she said, looking shocked.

49
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:06.972
"Well, we just said Mandy nervously.

50
00:03:08.773 --> 00:03:13.494
Like the girl, Vinnie and Mandy were wearing shirts made of animal skin.

51
00:03:14.775 --> 00:03:16.516
Vinnie wore pants underneath.

52
00:03:17.596 --> 00:03:20.217
Both Mandy and the girl wore a skirt.

53
00:03:22.798 --> 00:03:25.239
The girl stared angrily at Mandy.

54
00:03:25.259 --> 00:03:27.060
"You are white.

55
00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.241
You don't belong here," she said.

56
00:03:31.342 --> 00:03:34.103
Vinnie and Mandy did not know what to say.

57
00:03:36.384 --> 00:03:40.405
Just then, an old woman appeared from the same house.

58
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:44.247
She looked at Vinnie and Mandy curiously.

59
00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:46.048
"Who are you?"

60
00:03:47.108 --> 00:03:47.748
she asked.

61
00:03:49.149 --> 00:03:51.230
The children introduced themselves.

62
00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:54.971
"Do you know where you are?"

63
00:03:54.991 --> 00:03:56.872
the woman asked.

64
00:03:58.248 --> 00:04:01.870
"Uh, not really," Vinnie replied truthfully.

65
00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:07.272
"This is the village of the Iroquois," said the old woman.

66
00:04:07.292 --> 00:04:10.693
"So go home!"

67
00:04:11.413 --> 00:04:13.174
the girl said in a mean way.

68
00:04:13.194 --> 00:04:20.057
"Onatah, it is the time of the Green Corn Festival," the woman said softly.

69
00:04:20.077 --> 00:04:24.059
"It is a time of thanksgiving and forgiveness."

70
00:04:24.079 --> 00:04:29.290
"I know, Grandmother," Onatah mumbled.

71
00:04:30.532 --> 00:04:34.659
Nodding, the old woman looked at Vinnie and Mandy again.

72
00:04:34.679 --> 00:04:37.043
"I am Clan Mother.

73
00:04:38.104 --> 00:04:41.370
The People of the Longhouse welcome you," she said.
